5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of reinventing the wheel. Let’s actually read the old closure reports before we get excited again.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"May, while I admire your nostalgia, we must ensure the current crews can actually execute the plan. Let’s verify the roster books first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. We need to know if the late-turn pool has enough staff to handle the changes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I hear you, Benjamin. But I worry about hidden delays. Let’s check the joint operators' committee minutes to see who else must agree.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shizue: I hear you, Benjamin. But I worry about hidden delays. Let’s check the joint operators' committee minutes to see who else must agree.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the focus on execution. I’d like to examine the crew establishment and maintenance contract to understand our long-term obligations.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, checking rosters is fine, but it’s just a snapshot. I’m going to dig into the two pilots from eight years ago to see what actually failed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
